<title>USA: VISTA Information Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>VISTA Information Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>4th Quarter Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>			   December 31, 1996  December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(unaudited)	    (unaudited)</p>
<p>			   1996    1995 (B)     1996	  1995(A)</p>
<p>Net Revenues  $1,951,862  $2,286,637  $8,387,052  $7,839,926  Gross Margin     919,468   1,449,076   5,812,704   4,813,917</p>
<p> Net Loss    ( 2,157,892)($1,318,312) ( 6,498,712)($7,020,737)</p>
<p>Net Loss Per Share</p>
<p>			( 0.19)     ( 0.13)     ( 0.56)     ( 0.67)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>outstanding  11,522,274  10,542,734  11,522,274  10,542,734</p>
<p>NOTES: (A) Includes sales of VISTA Environmental Information, Inc, from March 1 - December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>(B) Includes cumulative adjustments of $1,267,771 reducing amortization charges related to the acquisition of VISTA Environmental Information.</p>
<p>This adjustment had a positive impact on net loss per share of $0.12.</p>
